// Verbatim port of the original site's <nav> + sidebar overlay (index.html).
// Markup and classes are unchanged so the existing nav/hamburger/sidebar CSS
// (styles/components/{nav,hamburger,sidebar}.css, loaded globally) applies
// identically.
//
// Deferred (separate, deliberate step): the nav information architecture — the
// Projects/About/Contact link targets are left as the original .html paths.
// Behavior (hamburger-menu.js) is wired in the next micro-step.
//
// One necessary fix vs. verbatim: the logo src is made root-absolute (/Assets/…)
// instead of relative, so it resolves from nested routes via the shared layout.
---

